From 6e3a3debc1c79b913fc584ddbeb447ac04db145e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tdulshan <tdulshan3@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:38:05 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Redragon K636 (Sinowealth PID 0049) keyboard
 controller

PID 0049 is shared by several Sinowealth keyboards and the older driver
for it is disabled because it bricked Redragon K618/K621 boards. This
controller asks for the model ID first and only continues for the K636
(probe reply 05 01 02 00 00 00 01 5D).

The config block is only ever read, changed in place and written back,
with the 5A A5 markers checked. Supports Direct mode (live frames) and
the 20 onboard effects with speed, brightness and any colour.

Refs #5588
